Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.17,0:00:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cu mult, mult timp în urmă,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:15.94,0:00:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}o calamitate cunoscută drept \NNergal a ieșit din Marea Cenușie
Dialogue: 99,0:00:19.13,0:00:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}și a distrus totul în calea sa.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Temut ca Regele Cenușă,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nergalul a fost provocat iar \Nși iar de războinici puternici,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.39,0:00:32.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar toți au fost răpuși.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.97,0:00:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare cât a trecut
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.15,0:00:38.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}de când umanitatea \Na renunțat să mai lupte?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.97,0:00:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și totuși, din când în când, \Nun nou erou își face apariția.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:25.07,0:01:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă Safir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.87,0:01:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă Safir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:28.84,0:01:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă Safir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.57,0:01:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă Safir! Prințesă Safir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.20,0:01:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prințesă Safir!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.13,0:01:44.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mâna ta!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.41,0:01:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt bine, Zirco.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.31,0:01:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.92,0:02:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all gone wrong. Everything.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.34,0:02:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.51,0:02:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă! Vin acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:21.38,0:02:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt yourself!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's blocked by the rubble.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.13,0:02:28.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi deschide imediat ușa! Rezistă!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.49,0:02:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Safir,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.16,0:02:34.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu are rost.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.49,0:02:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot spui acolo, mamă?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi învinge Nergalul!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.27,0:02:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt mult mai puternică!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.93,0:02:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll put an end to this horrible mess!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.65,0:02:48.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba! Deschide-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.38,0:02:51.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, Mother, and Father,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.79,0:02:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and everyone in the kingdom!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:55.14,0:02:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deschide-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.27,0:02:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deschide-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.50,0:02:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deschide-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.12,0:02:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Deschide-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.29,0:03:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Deschide-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.51,0:03:01.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Deschide-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.35,0:03:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu are rost să te \Nîmpotrivești acestei lumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.68,0:03:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu vrei să înțelegi asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am pierdut deja...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,complet.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.94,0:03:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.41,0:03:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to fight the Nergal\Nto the very end!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.12,0:03:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TM,{\an8}Safir...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.79,0:03:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.04,0:03:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Trebuie să accepți asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.34,0:03:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The weak survive
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}only by running from the strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.43,0:03:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Even if this world is destroyed,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.64,0:03:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to keep on living.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.89,0:03:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.23,0:03:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.52,0:03:48.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mamă!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.90,0:03:49.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deschide usă!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.98,0:03:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Open the door, Mother!\N- Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.48,0:03:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to go!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.52,0:03:54.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.57,0:03:59.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.23,0:05:20.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Goodness, am I soaked!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.70,0:05:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Zirco?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.49,0:05:31.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm making something. Something good.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.25,0:05:32.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something good?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.33,0:05:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something to get you going again,\NPrincess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.09,0:05:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mother always told me\Nnot to go looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.68,0:05:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No offense to the queen,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.39,0:05:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but this is your new weapon,\NPrincess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.02,0:05:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a weapon you'll need to keep living.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:52.27,0:05:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can use it to grab things,\Ncarry them, even hold someone.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.27,0:06:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To keep living, you've got to work\Nand you've got to eat.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My fingers...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.09,0:06:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.01,0:06:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fighting this world is pointless.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.68,0:06:29.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why can't you see that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's all that noise?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.91,0:06:48.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.26,0:07:03.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.68,0:07:11.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.51,0:07:12.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zirco...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:51.51,0:07:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, everyone,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,may the Angel of Hope guide us.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:56.14,0:07:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May the Angel of Hope guide us.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.66,0:08:16.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.54,0:08:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One loaf, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.80,0:08:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.34,0:08:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, any chance you can lower the price?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Work's dried up, and money's tight.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.43,0:08:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.95,0:08:52.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Food...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.49,0:08:58.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait... what?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.38,0:09:05.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.09,0:09:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.09,0:09:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smells good...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smells good!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.39,0:09:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smells so good...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.76,0:09:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're 50 gold each... so...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:21.06,0:09:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No... money...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.73,0:09:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.06,0:09:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They really must've been starving.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:50.97,0:09:52.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could've given them the leftovers
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.55,0:09:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,rather than bringing them\Nall the way here.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.01,0:09:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.43,0:09:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it was my place\Nto decide on my own.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.68,0:10:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the first warm meal\Nwe've had in ages.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.60,0:10:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.65,0:10:07.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:07.73,0:10:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has food really been that hard to come by?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.15,0:10:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We were driven from our home\Nseven years ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}With no work to be found,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.28,0:10:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}we wandered from place to place,\Nbarely scraping by and fending off hunger.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.41,0:10:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's a common story,\Nbut still... how unfortunate.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.21,0:10:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An old woman and her daughter alone.\NThat couldn't have been easy.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.17,0:10:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is absolutely delicious!\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.88,0:10:35.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Golden Rat, bone-in steak.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.84,0:10:38.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A local specialty from Gold Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Golden Rat steak!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.39,0:10:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want more! Seconds!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.31,0:10:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,\Nbut I can't give you more for free.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.44,0:10:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things are tough for us, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.90,0:10:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.15,0:10:54.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.61,0:10:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll do anything. Please let me work here.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're not hiring.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you know anywhere else\Nthat might be hiring?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:03.91,0:11:07.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're an outsider\Nlooking to make quick money...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, there's always mining.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.13,0:11:11.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't recommend it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.01,0:11:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done sitting around\Nfeeling sorry for myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.39,0:11:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.97,0:11:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Take me there.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.23,0:11:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What? Now?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.44,0:11:31.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're going like that?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.65,0:11:35.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pine, let them use the washing room.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.36,0:11:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.49,0:11:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Sapphire. Nice to meet you!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm Pine.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a cute name!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.83,0:11:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm from Silver Land.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But yeah...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.42,0:11:54.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Things have been pretty rough.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.55,0:11:55.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.51,0:11:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm glad you're feeling better.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.47,0:12:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome to Gold Land!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.51,0:12:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:12:10.56,0:12:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although the calamity\Nthat once struck Silver Land
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.52,0:12:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,has subsided and its aftermath contained,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.78,0:12:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the King of Ash has recently\Nentered another active phase.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:21.45,0:12:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a result,\Nmining operations have slowed.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.95,0:12:26.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the status
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.33,0:12:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,of the crystal energy source\Ndiscovered the other day?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.96,0:12:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been sealed off\Nand is currently under investigation.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep a close eye\Non any reaction from the King of Ash.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With crystal prices soaring,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.63,0:12:41.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,our nation's finances are under strain.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Illegal trading\Nalso shows no sign of stopping.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.43,0:12:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The other day,\Ncalls to defeat the King of Ash
Dialogue: 99,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,intensified among immigrants and miners
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.19,0:12:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and erupted into riots.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take firm action against them.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.61,0:13:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They say the Angel of Hope\Nis the one who can defeat the King of Ash.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:01.07,0:13:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dangerous idea.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.99,0:13:04.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone who incites riots
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.70,0:13:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or spreads dangerous ideas\Nis to be detained at once,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.54,0:13:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,flogged, and made an example of.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.17,0:13:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.42,0:13:16.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must not defy the King of Ash.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.38,0:13:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For us to survive,\Nwe must endure the pain.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.68,0:13:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May the Angel of Hope guide us.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.39,0:13:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May the Angel of Hope guide us.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.11,0:13:39.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I managed to get signed up.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.19,0:13:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.32,0:13:42.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck tomorrow!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.74,0:13:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.66,0:13:46.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's something I'm curious about,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.45,0:13:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}so you two head back first.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait, what is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.25,0:13:53.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.42,0:13:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair, Zirco!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:57.13,0:14:00.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait... I know! There's something\Neven more interesting over there!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.80,0:14:01.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.18,0:14:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Shall we?\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.94,0:14:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mother!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.27,0:14:21.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think I might've\Njust made my first friend ever!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:14:22.70,0:14:23.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.03,0:14:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?! No, no, no, it's nothing...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.45,0:14:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on, what is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.16,0:14:31.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's the legendary Golden Rat dish!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.79,0:14:32.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.83,0:14:36.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Golden Rat, here I come!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.13,0:14:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yikes, that was close.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I let myself get way too carried away.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.88,0:14:42.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Sapphire?\NHow does she even feel?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.18,0:14:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.18,0:14:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.65,0:14:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What was that about?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.28,0:15:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The north side's all high-end shops.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:07.28,0:15:08.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}High-end...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:11.91,0:15:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- I told you not to wander off over there!\N{\i1}- I see.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.79,0:15:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So outsiders aren't allowed over there.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.83,0:15:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.38,0:15:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It just reminded me of my country.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the talk about status and class.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.76,0:15:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal destroyed it all,\Nso it's gone now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.93,0:15:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.10,0:15:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay. Really.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.35,0:15:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.56,0:15:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about\Nbeing high-class or common.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.27,0:15:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just want to do something for others.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.94,0:15:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I keep asking myself what I can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.86,0:15:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still don't know yet, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the same.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.86,0:15:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.90,0:15:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I always want to help others,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.12,0:15:53.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I get scared and freeze up.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really have anything I'm good at.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.46,0:15:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I keep wondering\Nwhat I'm even meant to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.21,0:16:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we really are the same.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.34,0:16:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No, we're not.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.51,0:16:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your country went through\Nsomething terrible,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and you've been surviving on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.47,0:16:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're way more amazing, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.60,0:16:15.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm just...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.48,0:16:17.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not amazing at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.44,0:16:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still haven't been useful to anyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.23,0:16:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.53,0:16:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we find a way\Nto be useful together?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.74,0:16:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.07,0:16:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will you be my friend?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:31.28,0:16:33.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friend?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.24,0:16:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friend!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.08,0:16:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Sapphire! I found us a place to live.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? Really?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.17,0:16:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks, Zirco.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zirco.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.26,0:16:49.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.18,0:16:53.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made my first friend my own age.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.64,0:16:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you, now?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you fallen asleep?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.02,0:17:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.76,0:17:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.63,0:17:35.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this is Sapphire and Zirco.\NThey're joining our squad.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.47,0:17:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hello.\N- Hello.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Rock, squad leader.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.35,0:17:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Chorogy,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.73,0:17:42.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that's Hecate.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.40,0:17:44.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm Chick.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.98,0:17:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And I'm Tack.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.19,0:17:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're identical!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.53,0:17:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just our luck.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We finally get fresh recruits,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.03,0:17:54.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and one of them is an old lady.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.20,0:17:55.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lay off, Chorogy.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.95,0:17:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even an old lady's gotta eat, y'know.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.54,0:18:03.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, restrain him.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were behind the recent riot,\Nweren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.76,0:18:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:10.96,0:18:14.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lot are always\Ndumping the dangerous jobs on us!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:14.22,0:18:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon! You all said it too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:19.43,0:18:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.77,0:18:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who gives a damn about the King of Ash?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.02,0:18:27.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal's going to kill us all\Nin the end anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.36,0:18:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,\Nthe Mitra just sit back and watch!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.28,0:18:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lot...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.53,0:18:35.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Solitary confinement. Take him away.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.16,0:18:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the rules here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.49,0:18:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do not oppose the King of Ash.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:43.12,0:18:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be grateful to the King of Ash\Nthat you're alive today.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.75,0:18:48.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now back to work!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.59,0:18:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May the Angel of Hope guide us.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.13,0:18:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn that Velvet...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.01,0:18:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.05,0:18:57.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of the Mitra overseers.\NHe runs this mining site.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's giving me bad vibes.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:00.22,0:19:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything\Nthat'll get you noticed either.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.07,0:19:13.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how much crystal do we need to dig up?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.57,0:19:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As much as you can.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.99,0:19:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The more you mine, the more you get paid.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The more we mine, the more we get paid?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.24,0:19:23.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Golden Rat steak!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.79,0:19:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Idiot! It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:25.96,0:19:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Who're you calling an idiot?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:28.08,0:19:31.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't a job\Nrookies can just breeze through.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.63,0:19:33.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't know till I try!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.92,0:19:37.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you mine more than me,\NI'll give you my entire cut.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.22,0:19:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! I'll mine every last crystal!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.31,0:19:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'll tire out in no time.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.19,0:19:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's dig over there!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.65,0:19:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dig, dig, dig!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.53,0:19:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with the machine?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.11,0:19:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's cheating! Cheating!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:59.57,0:20:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I'm a genius inventor.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:08.79,0:20:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- We're on a roll today.\N- Heave-ho, heave-ho!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Might be able to call it early.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Steak, hooray! Steak, hooray!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.76,0:20:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Steak, hooray!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is her pace picking up?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:19.76,0:20:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to focus!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you always\Nturn everything into a competition?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:24.01,0:20:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dragged me into this.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.52,0:20:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, shut up already!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.07,0:20:36.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:36.61,0:20:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.74,0:20:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.78,0:20:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.80,0:21:01.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.09,0:21:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.10,0:21:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That isn't the one from Silver Land.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:21:13.73,0:21:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal again.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.61,0:21:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir Velvet, please evacuate at once.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.49,0:21:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get as many of the remaining\Nworkers out as you can.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.70,0:21:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't afford any more losses.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.45,0:21:25.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.33,0:21:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Run!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.83,0:21:32.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You there, don't stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.17,0:21:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too! Get to higher ground! Hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:36.30,0:21:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:53.15,0:21:54.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget it for now.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.86,0:21:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's run.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.69,0:21:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do we just have to run?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.62,0:22:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Rookie!\N- Idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.47,0:22:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:29.72,0:22:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire! Princess Sapph--
Dialogue: 99,0:22:37.52,0:22:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, lady. You better get out of here.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:40.23,0:22:41.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:53.54,0:22:55.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.21,0:22:56.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:08.64,0:23:10.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:31.41,0:23:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:32.91,0:23:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tack...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:56.98,0:23:58.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I lost everything.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:00.81,0:24:01.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Threw it all away.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:02.07,0:24:03.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Turns out,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.44,0:24:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't do anything on my own.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:06.11,0:24:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I going to die here?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:08.28,0:24:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fighting this world is pointless.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:11.66,0:24:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why can't you see that?!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:13.79,0:24:15.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:15.37,0:24:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't let it end like this!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:17.33,0:24:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't gotten anything back!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:38.12,0:25:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the heck?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:43.08,0:25:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hecate?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:47.75,0:25:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:02.89,0:26:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:06.02,0:26:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Rookie?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:07.02,0:26:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Princess Sapphire?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:08.65,0:26:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What the heck...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.03,0:26:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...is going on?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:11.90,0:26:13.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:13.49,0:26:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run while you can!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:29.30,0:26:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:34.63,0:26:35.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I can pull this off!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:13.51,0:27:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:21.81,0:27:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not safe to stay here.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:32.69,0:27:34.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:34.65,0:27:35.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:43.08,0:27:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do I do?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:46.46,0:27:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:57.80,0:28:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's immune to its spores too?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:00.14,0:28:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:01.18,0:28:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's like a knight.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:03.39,0:28:06.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire! Hang in there!\N- You've got this!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:08.40,0:28:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:10.86,0:28:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something's going on over there.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.27,0:28:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are they fighting that thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:17.45,0:28:18.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:20.28,0:28:22.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're going\Nhead-to-head with the King of Ash?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:22.87,0:28:25.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This mining site might be finished.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:26.29,0:28:29.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But thanks to them, we're alive.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:31.25,0:28:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn, it's tough!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:56.28,0:28:57.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 99,0:28:58.90,0:29:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:03.78,0:29:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:07.08,0:29:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:11.42,0:29:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might work.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:38.82,0:29:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- All right!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:45.28,0:29:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 99,0:29:46.79,0:29:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}at your service.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:09.22,0:30:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The King of Ash is retreating.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:11.85,0:30:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:13.90,0:30:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They did it! They really did it!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:15.90,0:30:17.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:18.32,0:30:19.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:24.11,0:30:26.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The King of Ash retreated?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:26.83,0:30:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Name the squad that was there.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:28.74,0:30:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir! The last remaining squad\Nwas Rock Squad!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:32.50,0:30:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Chorogy?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:33.83,0:30:36.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:37.00,0:30:38.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A demon's handiwork?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:38.92,0:30:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or... no...
Dialogue: 99,0:30:41.88,0:30:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Summon Rock Squad to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:44.09,0:30:46.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir!\N- Check the number of workers!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:46.76,0:30:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Treat the wounded immediately!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:48.35,0:30:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right away, sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:50.27,0:30:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if this world is destroyed,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:53.73,0:30:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to keep on living.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:57.90,0:31:00.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, horsey.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:04.61,0:31:08.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, is there a way\Nto turn this thing off?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:09.45,0:31:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!\NIsn't there some kind of off switch?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:17.00,0:31:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:18.92,0:31:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}At least it worked.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:23.80,0:31:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Guys!\N- Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:25.30,0:31:26.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:26.30,0:31:27.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:28.01,0:31:28.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:29.51,0:31:30.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:30.76,0:31:34.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Just kinda tired...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:35.02,0:31:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:36.98,0:31:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:38.94,0:31:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was the idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:43.19,0:31:44.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you crying about?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:44.99,0:31:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you were incredible.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:49.03,0:31:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll give you all my crystals!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:52.79,0:31:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:55.20,0:31:56.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hecate.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:27.82,0:32:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't see anyone like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:32.99,0:32:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We know someone's responsible.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:35.79,0:32:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're lying,\Nyou could face the death penalty.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:39.21,0:32:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Death?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:41.17,0:32:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Once the King of Ash is angered,
Dialogue: 99,0:32:43.59,0:32:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}it will come again and again\Nuntil the mine is destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:47.22,0:32:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You might all lose your jobs.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:49.51,0:32:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal tripped on its own,\Nbit its tongue, and ran off.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:53.68,0:32:54.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:54.76,0:32:56.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:56.10,0:32:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- What is it?\N- Actually...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:58.39,0:33:00.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your threats won't change anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:02.15,0:33:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:03.48,0:33:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If you notice anything,\Ndon't hesitate to say so.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:06.61,0:33:09.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we notice anything, we'll let you know.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:13.99,0:33:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen. We don't sell out our comrades.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:18.20,0:33:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody here fought the Nergal.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:21.50,0:33:22.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:22.67,0:33:23.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:25.34,0:33:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think they're telling the truth?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:30.80,0:33:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This matter is strictly confidential.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:33.30,0:33:34.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do not speak of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:34.76,0:33:35.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But--
Dialogue: 99,0:33:35.89,0:33:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is final.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:37.14,0:33:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I will take full responsibility.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:41.89,0:33:43.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To everyone's safe return!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:43.90,0:33:45.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:45.57,0:33:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Take this to the table.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:47.53,0:33:49.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm treating everyone tonight!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:53.11,0:33:55.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's favorite! Coming right up!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:57.49,0:34:00.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Pine! You too! Let's toast!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:00.46,0:34:01.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:02.29,0:34:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:06.84,0:34:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My beloved Golden Rat!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:09.55,0:34:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:10.97,0:34:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I've still got work to do, so...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:13.51,0:34:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, of course. Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:15.64,0:34:18.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to share\Nthis moment with you, Pine!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:18.93,0:34:20.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No worries at all!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:20.35,0:34:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should be the one apologizing\Nfor being so busy.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:22.85,0:34:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I heard the Nergal showed up,\NI was shocked.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:25.86,0:34:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, about that...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:27.57,0:34:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I thought we were done for.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:30.65,0:34:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone says you saved the day.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.07,0:34:36.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just got lucky.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:36.74,0:34:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pine!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:38.12,0:34:39.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:39.62,0:34:42.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking of some way\NI can help others too.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:42.96,0:34:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:44.00,0:34:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you take a look with me sometime?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:46.17,0:34:48.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously? I'm in, I'm in!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:48.46,0:34:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I should get back to work!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:50.09,0:34:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:53.30,0:34:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, you know,\Nif that knight hadn't shown up,
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.26,0:34:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't all be here.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:58.14,0:35:00.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rock told us\Nto keep quiet about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:00.35,0:35:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:02.27,0:35:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tonight, we all rank the same!\NWait, that came out wrong!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:05.77,0:35:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O Princess Knight, Angel of Hope!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:07.90,0:35:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please rid us of the Nergal!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:11.07,0:35:12.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:12.19,0:35:14.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:14.24,0:35:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you anger the King of Ash,\Nbad things happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:16.99,0:35:19.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Mitra say it all the time.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:19.45,0:35:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen up, pal! You're an immigrant.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:22.25,0:35:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on?\NThe Gold Landers, or the immigrants?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:25.29,0:35:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the truth gets out,\Nwe'll all be killed!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:27.83,0:35:28.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:29.00,0:35:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:29.92,0:35:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is the truth!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:31.88,0:35:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still talking?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:33.46,0:35:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:35.42,0:35:37.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my treat today,
Dialogue: 99,0:35:37.89,0:35:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so no fighting.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:40.64,0:35:42.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chorogy, sorry for dragging you\Ninto all that earlier.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:43.81,0:35:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.48,0:35:50.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's his problem?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:51.40,0:35:53.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get back to drinking!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:05.08,0:36:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, that Sapphire...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:07.71,0:36:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's letting all the praise\Ngo to her head.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:10.50,0:36:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just because she beat the King of Ash.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:13.05,0:36:13.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:23.51,0:36:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, that really is something.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:26.18,0:36:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:27.56,0:36:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That thing of yours.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:30.35,0:36:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, this.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:32.69,0:36:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to see it a bit more up close.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:40.36,0:36:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:41.70,0:36:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't keep me in suspense.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.92,0:36:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Think it's the crystals' doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:56.01,0:36:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:59.18,0:37:01.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nothing weird going on with your body?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:02.09,0:37:03.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:04.93,0:37:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything, I feel great.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:07.85,0:37:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you, now?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:09.19,0:37:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:11.56,0:37:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must've been scared.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:12.94,0:37:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did great.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:16.23,0:37:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:19.53,0:37:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must accept that.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:23.62,0:37:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zirco, you know,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:25.83,0:37:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I've finally\Nfigured out what I want to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:28.91,0:37:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Helping people?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:30.33,0:37:31.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:31.54,0:37:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As the Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 99,0:37:32.79,0:37:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't just want to fight the Nergal.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:34.84,0:37:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to work to help everyone\Nwho's in trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:37.46,0:37:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that's the reason I survived.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:41.26,0:37:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll help you.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:42.55,0:37:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is there anything you want
Dialogue: 99,0:37:44.35,0:37:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the great genius inventor Zirco to build?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:46.93,0:37:48.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:50.69,0:37:51.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:24.18,0:38:27.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh dear,\Nthe fire won't be put out in time.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:27.18,0:38:30.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just then, the cries\Nof someone trapped inside!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:30.39,0:38:32.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And at that very moment!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:32.73,0:38:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Knight, at your service!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:37.06,0:38:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And just like that, the girl is saved!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:42.11,0:38:43.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw that with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:43.49,0:38:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was so cool!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:45.28,0:38:47.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight showed up again?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:47.74,0:38:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was saved by her myself!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:00.09,0:39:01.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:02.05,0:39:05.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't really sure what it meant\Nto do something for others,
Dialogue: 99,0:39:05.30,0:39:08.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I started by writing down\Nthe things I'm good at.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.39,0:39:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:10.60,0:39:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, singing!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:13.06,0:39:14.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:14.69,0:39:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I actually managed to say it.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:16.98,0:39:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And just for you...
Dialogue: 99,0:39:18.61,0:39:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:20.40,0:39:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ta-da.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:22.32,0:39:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:26.86,0:39:27.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A flute.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:30.16,0:39:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just seemed like someone\Nwho really loves music.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:34.29,0:39:37.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Music is great.\NIt can really cheer people up.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:39.09,0:39:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:40.00,0:39:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:41.13,0:39:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's try it out right now!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:43.26,0:39:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:44.63,0:39:48.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Long, long ago{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:39:48.47,0:39:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There was a lone girl{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:39:51.43,0:39:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who wandered the land{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:39:54.68,0:40:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Winter-worn and hungry{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:40:07.11,0:40:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're Sapphire\Nfrom the crystal mines, correct?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:09.37,0:40:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:29.68,0:40:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:30.72,0:40:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dragging me here out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:07.76,0:41:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're the Ribbon Devil.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:11.89,0:41:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that power?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:15.60,0:41:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A power strong enough\Nto even defeat the Nergal.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:18.18,0:41:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you undergo\Nsome kind of special training?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:20.81,0:41:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And why aren't you affected by its spores?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:22.98,0:41:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:24.19,0:41:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't dodge the question. Answer me.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:25.86,0:41:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:27.23,0:41:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fell into some sort of energy pocket\Nin the mines.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:30.74,0:41:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then all this power\Njust started pouring out.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:32.82,0:41:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's the power of the crystals.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:34.45,0:41:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The body shouldn't be able to withstand\Nthat much high-density photon energy.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:40.21,0:41:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're an immigrant.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:41.79,0:41:42.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From which country?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:44.17,0:41:45.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silver Land.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:46.25,0:41:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silver Land...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:49.55,0:41:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:51.63,0:41:53.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the cursed princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:55.18,0:41:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silver Land was destroyed\Nbecause of you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:00.48,0:42:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trying to dodge responsibility?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:02.69,0:42:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The queen let the country fall
Dialogue: 99,0:42:04.98,0:42:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just to keep you alive.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:06.77,0:42:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful example\Nof a mother's love.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:09.74,0:42:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:10.82,0:42:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:13.07,0:42:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really don't know?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:15.07,0:42:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal feeds on pure souls.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:18.20,0:42:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they had continued\Noffering sacrifices to the Nergal,
Dialogue: 99,0:42:20.62,0:42:22.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your country would have stayed safe.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:23.58,0:42:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In Silver Land,
Dialogue: 99,0:42:25.21,0:42:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as the princess,\Nyou were meant to bear that role.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:29.51,0:42:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:30.76,0:42:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:31.76,0:42:34.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the queen refused to let that happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:34.93,0:42:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, the kingdom fell.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:37.93,0:42:39.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You destroyed it,
Dialogue: 99,0:42:40.10,0:42:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:41.64,0:42:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 99,0:42:43.19,0:42:44.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:42:45.65,0:42:46.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:47.65,0:42:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop spreading your curse any further.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:50.23,0:42:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to provoke the Nergal again
Dialogue: 99,0:42:52.03,0:42:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and risk destroying Gold Land, too?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:54.99,0:42:56.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This ribbon's power
Dialogue: 99,0:42:57.20,0:42:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can fight the Nergal.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:59.16,0:43:02.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,\Nthat power will only bring disaster.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:02.83,0:43:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a burden we didn't ask for.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:05.67,0:43:06.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 99,0:43:07.38,0:43:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to use this power to do something.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:11.59,0:43:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:13.09,0:43:15.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can I break my curse?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:16.22,0:43:18.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to fight?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:37.36,0:43:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ow...
Dialogue: 99,0:43:39.33,0:43:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Seriously, watch where you're going!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:43.00,0:43:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll be off then.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:45.58,0:43:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:46.79,0:43:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where have you been? You weren't at work!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:50.59,0:43:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something smells off.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:58.47,0:44:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why couldn't I say anything back there?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:44:02.85,0:44:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some friend I am.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:44:04.39,0:44:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a haul!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:07.69,0:44:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zirco!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:09.27,0:44:10.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pine?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:11.15,0:44:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:12.32,0:44:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire was taken away by the Mitra.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:15.24,0:44:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Your best bet is to ask this guy.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:19.20,0:44:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the one who ratted\NSapphire's secret out to Velvet.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:23.99,0:44:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's secret?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:27.12,0:44:29.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 99,0:44:29.21,0:44:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the knight who defeated the Nergal,\Nis Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:33.46,0:44:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:36.59,0:44:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two knew?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:38.43,0:44:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured it out when she saved me.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:41.10,0:44:43.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She even saved him,\Nand he went and snitched on her.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:44.01,0:44:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only a real jerk would do that!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:46.18,0:44:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Pine,
Dialogue: 99,0:44:48.06,0:44:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mitra questioned me when I was alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:51.36,0:44:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm weak. I panicked.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:54.61,0:44:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought they were going to execute me!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:57.49,0:44:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:58.45,0:45:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Execute you?!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:00.53,0:45:02.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd end up like all the others,
Dialogue: 99,0:45:03.08,0:45:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,locked up in a dungeon!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:06.54,0:45:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, out of nowhere,\NSir Velvet drew his sword...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:09.92,0:45:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:14.29,0:45:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you the one crying?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:17.05,0:45:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:18.97,0:45:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:20.68,0:45:23.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to save you!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:23.18,0:45:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you actually sorry?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:25.26,0:45:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think crying's going to fix this?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:28.10,0:45:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pine.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:31.23,0:45:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:34.11,0:45:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Sorry for making you worry--\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:37.11,0:45:38.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:39.36,0:45:41.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:41.28,0:45:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're safe!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:42.91,0:45:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? No way, you're alive?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:46.87,0:45:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for making you worry, Pine.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:49.33,0:45:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But how did you get back?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:51.08,0:45:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a relief...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:52.08,0:45:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you took Velvet down?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:54.33,0:45:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:56.21,0:45:59.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, it's kind of a long story.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:09.06,0:46:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:11.02,0:46:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said let me go!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:14.31,0:46:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:15.90,0:46:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:16.98,0:46:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's seen too much.\NWe can't let her leave alive.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:19.40,0:46:23.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We chased her off again and again,\Nbut she wouldn't stop following us.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:23.16,0:46:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we eliminate her?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:24.91,0:46:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:25.82,0:46:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you lay a finger on Princess Sapphire,\Nyou're going to regret it!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:30.45,0:46:32.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She won't be a problem!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:32.12,0:46:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You expect us to believe that?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:33.46,0:46:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so fun\Nabout picking on an old lady?!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:36.84,0:46:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even an old woman could be an informant.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:40.01,0:46:43.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I grew up with her. She's family.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:45.43,0:46:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:46.47,0:46:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:50.52,0:46:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:51.98,0:46:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she tries anything,
Dialogue: 99,0:46:54.48,0:46:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll cut her down.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:56.02,0:46:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:00.98,0:47:02.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our destination{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:02.99,0:47:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is the Pillar of Creation.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:05.70,0:47:08.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's connected to another world\Nwhere the Nergal dwell.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:10.12,0:47:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Nergal were not originally\Ncreatures of this world.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:14.00,0:47:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can't kill them.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:15.96,0:47:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They might not even be living beings.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:17.58,0:47:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then what are the Nergal?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:20.50,0:47:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All we know is that they feed on souls.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:24.51,0:47:27.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Normally, they satisfy\Ntheir hunger with crystals,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:27.68,0:47:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but when those run out, they come\Nto the city to devour human souls.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:31.93,0:47:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can we even beat something like that?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:35.06,0:47:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are factors\Nconnecting the Nergal's realm to ours.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:39.11,0:47:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's more than one,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:40.57,0:47:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but if we destroy them all,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:42.53,0:47:44.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we can sever the link\Nbetween the Nergal and our world.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:45.45,0:47:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How can you be so sure?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:48.41,0:47:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Look.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:49.32,0:47:51.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Long ago, there was\Na great nation in this region.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:52.08,0:47:54.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one remembers it now, though.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:54.33,0:47:55.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In its ancient records,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:56.00,0:47:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we found accounts of people\Nwho fought the Nergal.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:59.63,0:48:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But they were wiped out.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:02.30,0:48:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The one that destroyed that great nation{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:04.46,0:48:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was likely the same Nergal\Nthat appeared in your country.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:07.76,0:48:08.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:09.09,0:48:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It has appeared at regular intervals\Nthroughout history,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:12.39,0:48:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}each time wiping out great nations.\NIt's the leader of the Nergal.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:16.44,0:48:18.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So someday\Nwe'll have to face that one too.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:19.10,0:48:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the outcome\Nthat the Mitra fear most.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:22.77,0:48:26.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to see how close your power\Ncan get us to the truth{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:28.32,0:48:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}about the Nergal.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:32.37,0:48:33.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:35.16,0:48:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Pillar of Creation.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:43.38,0:48:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The energy there is too strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:45.42,0:48:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't get any closer.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:49.93,0:48:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:51.72,0:48:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lost your nerve now that we're here?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:54.47,0:48:55.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:55.64,0:48:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:48:58.60,0:49:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use this!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:01.31,0:49:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You finished it?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:02.81,0:49:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You just press this here...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:06.11,0:49:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Like it? Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:09.11,0:49:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thanks, Zirco.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:12.24,0:49:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Right! Just make sure you come back!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:42.81,0:49:43.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is it.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:07.71,0:50:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Knight, at your service.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:13.72,0:50:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:39.08,0:50:41.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Mother? Father?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:11.57,0:51:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Nergal!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:12.53,0:51:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:44.23,0:51:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:57.78,0:51:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This thing is incredible!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:02.83,0:52:04.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four left.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:06.00,0:52:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:32.86,0:52:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:52.67,0:52:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:54.30,0:52:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must not fight,
Dialogue: 99,0:52:56.34,0:52:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even if this world is destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:44.10,0:53:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 99,0:54:01.32,0:54:03.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I just have to destroy that thing.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:03.24,0:54:04.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.01,0:54:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:40.15,0:54:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:48.83,0:54:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:02.26,0:55:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:19.69,0:55:21.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:44.67,0:55:45.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:47.26,0:55:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your reward.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:48.60,0:55:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a reward for this mission?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:52.81,0:55:54.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you think there wasn't?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:04.15,0:56:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we can eat all sorts of good stuff!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:09.95,0:56:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we have a whole roasted Golden Rat,\Nserved with an herb sauce.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:15.91,0:56:18.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:21.84,0:56:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In a foreign tongue{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:56:25.17,0:56:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From a distant land{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:56:28.38,0:56:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You offered the same prayer\NAgain and again{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:56:35.73,0:56:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:37.02,0:56:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I dragged you out\Non your first day off in a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:41.02,0:56:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:42.61,0:56:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a nice little break.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:44.82,0:56:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet's been working me\Nto the bone lately.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:49.16,0:56:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've finally found it.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:51.45,0:56:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason I survived.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:54.87,0:56:58.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right then, you'll have to show me\Nmore of your talents, too, Pine.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:58.79,0:56:59.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,0:56:59.87,0:57:01.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sure you're not overdoing it?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:03.38,0:57:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the flute!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:04.34,0:57:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, come back!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:07.67,0:57:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hakobe, don't be a nuisance.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:11.05,0:57:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:13.81,0:57:15.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 99,0:57:15.93,0:57:18.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're always like this, Hakobe.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:18.14,0:57:20.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk, Nazuna.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:20.85,0:57:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:26.82,0:57:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know this song?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:30.53,0:57:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The Winter-Worn Traveler," right?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:33.41,0:57:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Play it again.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:35.16,0:57:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you like music?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:36.83,0:57:37.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:38.46,0:57:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're always practicing singing.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:42.83,0:57:45.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This girl is really good at singing too.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:45.55,0:57:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Want to hear?\N- Wait! Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 99,0:57:52.14,0:57:55.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Long, long ago{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:57:55.60,0:57:58.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There was a lone girl{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:57:58.39,0:58:01.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who wandered...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:58:08.53,0:58:09.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pine!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:09.65,0:58:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:29.96,0:58:31.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry for interrupting.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:36.10,0:58:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all, I'm the one\Nwho should apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:41.48,0:58:43.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those children...
Dialogue: 99,0:58:44.40,0:58:46.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're my siblings.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:46.15,0:58:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is where I grew up.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:48.73,0:58:51.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}King{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:58:51.57,0:58:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:52.49,0:58:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O King...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:58:54.70,0:58:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire comes home\Nexhausted every day lately.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:59.33,0:59:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you making her do?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:02.12,0:59:04.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm having her atone.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:04.29,0:59:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atone?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:05.75,0:59:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She hasn't told you?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:07.34,0:59:08.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ask her yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:08.84,0:59:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A blue bud{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:59:14.47,0:59:15.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This song...
Dialogue: 99,0:59:15.72,0:59:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A pure angel given in sacrifice{\i}
Dialogue: 99,0:59:21.77,0:59:23.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let there be any more sacrifices.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:52.67,0:59:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:56.51,1:00:00.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The last confirmed sighting\Nof the King of Ash was three months ago.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:01.22,1:00:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mining sites are steadily recovering.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:04.35,1:00:08.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Output has rebounded\Nto levels higher than before.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:09.06,1:00:10.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:10.90,1:00:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next, regarding the scene\Nof the recent fire...
Dialogue: 99,1:00:17.41,1:00:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I may!
Dialogue: 99,1:00:18.91,1:00:22.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is something urgent\NI must report, Your Holiness!
Dialogue: 99,1:00:27.62,1:00:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're certain\Nyou have no idea what caused it?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:30.71,1:00:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Holiness. None at all.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:32.71,1:00:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For now, it can be contained\Nwith sterilization.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:35.76,1:00:38.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if it worsens any further,
Dialogue: 99,1:00:38.30,1:00:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,under the emergency provisions,
Dialogue: 99,1:00:40.51,1:00:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we will have no choice\Nbut to perform the ritual sacrifice.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:45.52,1:00:46.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:48.60,1:00:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:49.90,1:00:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive any betrayal of the Mitra\Nwho raised you to be who you are today.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:55.23,1:00:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, trust me.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:57.24,1:00:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will not disappoint you, Your Holiness.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:06.45,1:01:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You called, so here I am.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:12.34,1:01:14.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, what is it?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:14.55,1:01:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why call me all the way out here?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:16.96,1:01:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the time being, we'll be leaving
Dialogue: 99,1:01:18.63,1:01:22.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,both the Pillar of Creation\Nand the Nergal alone.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:22.10,1:01:23.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:24.35,1:01:28.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Pillar of Creation\Nhas begun appearing near the Gate.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:28.85,1:01:31.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't act rashly and provoke the Nergal.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:31.52,1:01:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's bad! We can't just ignore it!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:34.61,1:01:36.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Mitra is handling it.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:36.73,1:01:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait until things settle down.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:38.65,1:01:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'd be faster if I handled it!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:41.86,1:01:43.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand by and watch!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:44.41,1:01:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Mitra is not incompetent.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:46.83,1:01:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This level of threat is manageable.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:49.21,1:01:51.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The immigrant district\Nis right by the Gate.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:52.29,1:01:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If something were to happen...
Dialogue: 99,1:01:55.34,1:01:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,someone might be sacrificed!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:59.80,1:02:02.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you expect\Nto save the world without sacrifices?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:03.34,1:02:06.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how you survived too, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:08.52,1:02:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's exactly what I hate!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:10.89,1:02:13.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If danger is closing in,\NI can't just do nothing!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:14.48,1:02:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't want to lose anyone ever again!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:17.86,1:02:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you really think you can contain it?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:21.53,1:02:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If the Pillar of Creation\Ncontinues to grow
Dialogue: 99,1:02:24.78,1:02:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and the Nergal appear once more,
Dialogue: 99,1:02:27.83,1:02:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the Mitra will likely demand\Nan even greater sacrifice.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:31.41,1:02:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:33.12,1:02:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}In this country,
Dialogue: 99,1:02:35.04,1:02:36.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the sacrifices are the church's orphans.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:38.25,1:02:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A cursed fate, just like yours.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:43.89,1:02:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 99,1:02:45.68,1:02:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet, you want to save those children.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:48.56,1:02:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't kid yourself\Ninto thinking you understand me!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:52.44,1:02:54.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reality you imagine
Dialogue: 99,1:02:54.73,1:02:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the reality I live in\Nare not the same.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:00.44,1:03:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:04.24,1:03:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what was supposed to happen\Nto me in Silver Land anyway.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:08.62,1:03:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the time comes,
Dialogue: 99,1:03:09.95,1:03:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take their place.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:12.96,1:03:16.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So let me do everything I can\Nuntil the very end.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:18.80,1:03:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I possess the power.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:29.93,1:03:31.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This area is currently sealed off!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:31.97,1:03:33.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure everything's okay?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:33.60,1:03:34.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No pushing!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:35.23,1:03:36.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For your safety,
Dialogue: 99,1:03:36.81,1:03:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,please remain indoors\Nuntil further notice.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:41.78,1:03:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For now, it's being contained.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:44.03,1:03:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Pillar is shrinking as well.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:49.62,1:03:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We may be able to stop it\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:55.75,1:03:56.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:56.92,1:03:58.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, just let us in!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:58.13,1:03:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stay calm!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:04.17,1:04:06.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Knight, at your service.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:07.47,1:04:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Knight!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:10.89,1:04:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:12.85,1:04:13.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:13.98,1:04:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:27.74,1:04:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's collapsing!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:32.29,1:04:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:42.92,1:04:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back, back, back!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:47.34,1:04:50.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can she really handle it?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:56.73,1:04:57.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:01.52,1:05:03.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An evacuation order has been issued.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:04.03,1:05:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All citizens, please evacuate...
Dialogue: 99,1:05:05.78,1:05:09.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Women and children, this way!\N- What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:11.03,1:05:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Where are your mom and dad?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:15.95,1:05:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back! Move back!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:17.75,1:05:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:20.67,1:05:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The country is going into full lockdown!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:35.97,1:05:36.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've found it.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:36.93,1:05:37.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:44.27,1:05:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion. It is I, Velvet.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:47.86,1:05:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:53.28,1:05:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You summoned me,
Dialogue: 99,1:05:54.87,1:05:55.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Holiness?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:00.16,1:06:02.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand without my saying it.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:07.42,1:06:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your doing.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:13.55,1:06:14.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:16.56,1:06:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:18.14,1:06:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl may be\Nthe Angel of Hope we have long awaited.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:23.31,1:06:27.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With her mysterious power,\Nshe was able to seal the Nergal.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:27.69,1:06:29.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And not just once or twice.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:29.94,1:06:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Defeating the Nergal\Ngoes against Mitra's rites,
Dialogue: 99,1:06:33.57,1:06:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but with that power,
Dialogue: 99,1:06:35.32,1:06:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we could put an end\Nto the source of our suffering.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:38.16,1:06:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:39.91,1:06:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:41.16,1:06:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl is not the Angel of Hope.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:45.46,1:06:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Holiness!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:46.92,1:06:49.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You place too much faith in humanity.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:51.17,1:06:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans are not as strong as you believe.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:55.97,1:06:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That applies equally\Nto the masses and to that girl.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:00.35,1:07:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When faced with harsh trials,
Dialogue: 99,1:07:04.02,1:07:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the weak are crushed.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:06.52,1:07:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is why we of the Mitra\Nguide the fragile populace
Dialogue: 99,1:07:10.86,1:07:13.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and, at times, act as their shield.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:13.70,1:07:15.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:16.03,1:07:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:17.45,1:07:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans are weak of heart.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:20.91,1:07:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can only bond by creating enemies
Dialogue: 99,1:07:24.50,1:07:26.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,within their own circle.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:26.25,1:07:29.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That applies to you as well as me.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:29.67,1:07:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Holiness...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:32.09,1:07:34.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I still...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:36.14,1:07:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The weak are sacrificed\Nto those with greater power.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:40.14,1:07:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That is the law of nature.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:42.89,1:07:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The calamity known as the King of Ash\Npreys upon humanity.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:46.52,1:07:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That reality cannot be overturned.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:50.98,1:07:54.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as humans eat Golden Rats,
Dialogue: 99,1:07:54.61,1:07:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so too do humans prey upon one another.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:58.20,1:08:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}People are happiest when protected\Nwithin a closed, peaceful world.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:04.58,1:08:06.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And you shattered that.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:21.93,1:08:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Report the situation.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:23.56,1:08:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:24.48,1:08:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say someone is fighting\Nthe King of Ash at the border gate.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:30.06,1:08:30.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:30.98,1:08:31.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:36.61,1:08:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:39.62,1:08:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 99,1:08:40.83,1:08:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arise!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:45.25,1:08:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chorogy?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:47.83,1:08:49.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with that outfit?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:50.54,1:08:54.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now's the time\Nwe help the Princess Knight!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:55.05,1:08:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help her how?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:56.84,1:08:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean fight the Nergal?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:59.34,1:09:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:00.72,1:09:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:01.85,1:09:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:03.72,1:09:05.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how,
Dialogue: 99,1:09:05.22,1:09:08.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there has to be something\NI can do without fighting.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:08.19,1:09:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have things I want to protect too.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:11.65,1:09:14.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is something I have to do myself!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:15.94,1:09:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:18.78,1:09:20.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's been protecting us this whole time,
Dialogue: 99,1:09:21.95,1:09:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so it's only right I give something back!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:24.74,1:09:25.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:26.66,1:09:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 99,1:09:27.87,1:09:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:29.25,1:09:31.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even Chorogy managed to find the courage.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:32.00,1:09:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got no choice!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:35.30,1:09:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Yeah!\N- All right!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:36.51,1:09:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- C'mon, guys!\N- Okay!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:50.77,1:09:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad. They just keep coming.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:53.77,1:09:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:56.53,1:09:57.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:08.93,1:11:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:35.87,1:11:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 99,1:11:51.97,1:11:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:53.73,1:11:55.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:55.23,1:11:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:58.73,1:11:59.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 99,1:12:14.46,1:12:15.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to go!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:15.79,1:12:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chorogy!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:43.03,1:12:44.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gate doors are opening!
Dialogue: 99,1:13:18.89,1:13:22.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, bad timing...
Dialogue: 99,1:13:22.65,1:13:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You've just twisted it.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:25.78,1:13:27.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, where's Chorogy?
Dialogue: 99,1:13:27.19,1:13:29.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He went on ahead that way.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:36.04,1:13:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 99,1:13:48.30,1:13:49.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 99,1:13:49.30,1:13:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:51.14,1:13:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 99,1:13:53.14,1:13:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 99,1:13:56.68,1:13:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guess the only thing\NI'm good for is helping people.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:09.19,1:14:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:26.04,1:14:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 99,1:14:27.17,1:14:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,1:14:28.76,1:14:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chorogy!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:49.69,1:14:51.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:54.16,1:14:55.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:55.12,1:14:57.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take down the Nergal!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:58.12,1:14:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it down!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:59.58,1:15:01.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:04.63,1:15:06.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone's fighting up there.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:08.17,1:15:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Angel of Hope...
Dialogue: 99,1:15:10.21,1:15:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone...
Dialogue: 99,1:15:12.05,1:15:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone, help us!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:32.44,1:15:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 99,1:15:34.66,1:15:35.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Angel!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:36.99,1:15:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please... save us.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:25.43,1:17:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:27.02,1:17:30.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I defeated the Nergal,\Nso why won't the gate close?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:32.90,1:17:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's because it's still alive.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:17.94,1:18:20.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should at least get Pine\Nto the upper levels.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:21.61,1:18:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll ask someone I know.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:23.82,1:18:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, we have to save her.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:25.74,1:18:29.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mitra, please help us.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:31.50,1:18:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This world is awful.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:18:35.38,1:18:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the worst of it all is me.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:18:39.88,1:18:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire risked her life\Nto protect everyone,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:18:43.93,1:18:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:18:45.47,1:18:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've done nothing.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:18:49.52,1:18:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we find\Na way to be useful together?
Dialogue: 99,1:18:52.89,1:18:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 99,1:18:54.23,1:18:55.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will you be my friend?
Dialogue: 99,1:18:56.06,1:18:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:18:58.73,1:19:00.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm her friend, and yet...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:01.74,1:19:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've gone with her that day.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:06.66,1:19:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've pressed her harder.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:10.83,1:19:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've said something to her.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:15.25,1:19:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When things were hardest,\NI left her all alone.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:19.00,1:19:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did nothing.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:21.84,1:19:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just kept letting her protect me.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:24.55,1:19:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What kind of friend does that?{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:19:39.65,1:19:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is how the energy\Nwas being amplified.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:45.07,1:19:46.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the altar ready?
Dialogue: 99,1:19:47.57,1:19:49.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will be finished shortly.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:49.66,1:19:50.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:51.20,1:19:52.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gather the children
Dialogue: 99,1:19:53.41,1:19:55.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and as many Mitra volunteers as possible.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:56.21,1:19:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:58.59,1:20:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still cannot accept this!
Dialogue: 99,1:20:00.67,1:20:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why must the orphans be sacrificed?
Dialogue: 99,1:20:03.76,1:20:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why can it not be Sapphire instead?
Dialogue: 99,1:20:06.55,1:20:08.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make Sapphire the sacrifice!
Dialogue: 99,1:20:08.55,1:20:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you still not understand?
Dialogue: 99,1:20:10.76,1:20:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you're advocating\Nis violence for its own sake.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:13.64,1:20:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That mindset\Nwill only worsen the situation.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:18.19,1:20:19.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But...
Dialogue: 99,1:20:19.90,1:20:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Nergal are life and death.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:22.36,1:20:26.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The cycle of destruction and creation,\Nthe very motion of this world.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:27.20,1:20:29.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}They encompass even emotions\Nand memory itself.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:30.49,1:20:32.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Within an eternal struggle\Nand unending chaos,
Dialogue: 99,1:20:33.08,1:20:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}humanity will forever continue\Nto lose to the Nergal.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:38.00,1:20:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only thing we can do is pray.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:20:42.55,1:20:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only prayers born\Nfrom the depths of the soul,{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:20:45.09,1:20:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}true requiems, can calm this unjust world.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:20:48.80,1:20:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We must entreat the countless souls\Nand memories that dwell within the Nergal.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:20:54.72,1:20:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For that, we need grief\Nfrom the depths of our hearts{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:20:58.35,1:21:00.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and true compassion.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:21:01.52,1:21:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The orphans we have carefully raised\Nare the ones whose pain{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:21:07.20,1:21:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}becomes the offering.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:21:11.91,1:21:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl is not, to us,\Nan object of emotion.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:16.79,1:21:19.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are not Silver Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:20.29,1:21:24.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is because there is pain\Nthat we can pray.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:25.26,1:21:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prayer without pain is weak.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:31.51,1:21:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, let us do our work.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:35.27,1:21:37.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will send the people back alive,
Dialogue: 99,1:21:37.60,1:21:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with as few sacrifices as possible.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:43.94,1:21:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They will be here any moment.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:53.12,1:21:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're late, Pine.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:56.41,1:21:57.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 99,1:21:58.04,1:22:00.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all here.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:01.83,1:22:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's starting.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:11.51,1:22:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All systems nominal.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:33.87,1:22:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:34.99,1:22:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its true form.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:37.33,1:22:39.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Begin the ritual.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:41.00,1:22:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}King{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:22:44.04,1:22:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O King{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:22:48.42,1:22:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grant me{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:22:52.30,1:22:57.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your divine guidance{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:22:57.10,1:23:00.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For I am{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:01.06,1:23:06.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A blue soul{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:06.86,1:23:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your faithful{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:10.03,1:23:15.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angel of prayer{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:25.13,1:23:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}King{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:27.88,1:23:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O King{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:32.59,1:23:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grant me{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:36.14,1:23:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pure joy{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:41.14,1:23:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For I am\NA blue destiny{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:23:47.40,1:23:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the end, I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:51.78,1:23:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This destruction is all my fault.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:55.70,1:23:57.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a disaster.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:00.16,1:24:01.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire's over there!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:02.66,1:24:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire...
Dialogue: 99,1:24:04.46,1:24:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, why isn't she transforming?
Dialogue: 99,1:24:10.09,1:24:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:13.13,1:24:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why her power isn't working!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:16.89,1:24:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 99,1:24:24.81,1:24:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not too long now.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:26.27,1:24:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All that's left\Nis to offer up the orphans.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:29.65,1:24:33.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this, may the King of Ash\Nfinally be appeased.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:34.65,1:24:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must not let their lives be in vain.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:41.28,1:24:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}King{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:24:44.04,1:24:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O King{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:24:48.63,1:24:55.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grant me\NYour warm embrace{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:24:56.13,1:24:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:57.18,1:25:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For I am{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:25:01.05,1:25:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A blue bud{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:25:05.31,1:25:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:07.77,1:25:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop him!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:11.31,1:25:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:13.07,1:25:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet appears to have fled!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:15.44,1:25:16.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apprehend him at once!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:16.82,1:25:17.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:25.33,1:25:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are the immigrants here?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:27.66,1:25:28.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let them through!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:35.84,1:25:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give that back!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:38.84,1:25:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not let them get away!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:40.84,1:25:42.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chick!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:42.76,1:25:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:43.72,1:25:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Counting on you!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:49.02,1:25:49.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:49.94,1:25:51.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:51.10,1:25:52.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:59.78,1:26:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hecate, throw it here!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:03.20,1:26:04.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pine!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:04.66,1:26:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grab on!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:21.26,1:26:22.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pine! Go!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:24.89,1:26:26.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:38.23,1:26:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have the power to save the world,
Dialogue: 99,1:26:40.95,1:26:43.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but when things are this bad,\NI have to do something.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:43.82,1:26:46.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't just keep relying on you\Nto protect me.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:48.62,1:26:50.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:50.33,1:26:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But maybe this wasn't\Nthe reason I survived, after all.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:55.13,1:26:57.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The reason you survived, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 99,1:26:57.42,1:27:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's because you're the person\NI love more than anyone!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:02.47,1:27:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm weak.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:05.35,1:27:06.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like I can win.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:07.68,1:27:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm cursed, after all.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:13.39,1:27:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Curses are born from words,
Dialogue: 99,1:27:17.73,1:27:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so words are what can break them.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:20.19,1:27:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:21.36,1:27:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been fighting\Nall this time, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:25.28,1:27:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you struggle like this, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:29.12,1:27:31.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you hurt so much.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:31.87,1:27:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And that's why you survived!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:34.37,1:27:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's why you're strong!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:36.63,1:27:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's why the Princess Knight
Dialogue: 99,1:27:38.63,1:27:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is my hero!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:50.93,1:27:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Pine.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:52.77,1:27:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've cheered me up!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:03.86,1:28:05.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:10.62,1:28:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nazuna! Hakobe!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:12.83,1:28:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:13.96,1:28:15.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let go of you again.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:17.58,1:28:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Velvet?
Dialogue: 99,1:28:20.88,1:28:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it all going to end here?
Dialogue: 99,1:28:23.21,1:28:24.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone...
Dialogue: 99,1:28:39.23,1:28:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Knight, at your service.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:44.57,1:28:45.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Princess...
Dialogue: 99,1:28:45.82,1:28:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knight?
Dialogue: 99,1:28:48.20,1:28:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 99,1:28:54.33,1:28:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this. I promise!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:56.75,1:28:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get everyone as far away as possible!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:58.62,1:29:00.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you really save them all?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:00.84,1:29:02.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The children from the orphanage,
Dialogue: 99,1:29:02.96,1:29:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the citizens of this country?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:05.55,1:29:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll save them.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:07.51,1:29:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what this power is for.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:31.82,1:29:36.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}7 YEARS EARLIER
Dialogue: 99,1:30:03.31,1:30:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:04.82,1:30:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've seen you before.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:17.08,1:30:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:40.43,1:30:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:42.94,1:30:44.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello! Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:46.82,1:30:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:49.86,1:30:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:52.20,1:30:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:57.33,1:30:58.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:59.12,1:31:01.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one gets hurt here anymore.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:02.00,1:31:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,1:31:03.88,1:31:07.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It means you've fulfilled your role.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:07.75,1:31:09.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chorogy? Is that you, Chorogy?
Dialogue: 99,1:31:10.30,1:31:11.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:13.93,1:31:14.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 99,1:31:15.05,1:31:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!\NI'm so sorry I couldn't save you.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:19.93,1:31:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 99,1:31:21.48,1:31:24.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All the heroes\Nwho have challenged the Nergal until now.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:24.60,1:31:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same as us.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:26.90,1:31:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They stood up to the Nergal...
Dialogue: 99,1:31:29.40,1:31:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But the painful, bitter battle is over.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:34.36,1:31:35.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 99,1:31:35.53,1:31:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a world where no one gets hurt.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:38.78,1:31:40.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a place within history and memory,
Dialogue: 99,1:31:40.91,1:31:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where everyone lives\Nin peace and happiness.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:45.17,1:31:48.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another possibility,\Na life that might have been.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:49.13,1:31:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A story without an end.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:52.09,1:31:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ash is a soul burned by flame.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:56.18,1:31:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Death itself.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:58.64,1:32:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cleansed, and in time,\Nreborn as a new heart.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:03.64,1:32:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is its place of rest.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:09.77,1:32:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The story people long for.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:12.24,1:32:14.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a dream!
Dialogue: 99,1:32:14.24,1:32:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone outside is still fighting.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:16.53,1:32:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm fighting for!
Dialogue: 99,1:32:20.16,1:32:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone\Nwho's been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:26.79,1:32:29.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}BEFORE THE ALTAR
Dialogue: 99,1:32:31.21,1:32:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 99,1:32:33.51,1:32:35.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not moving at all.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:36.01,1:32:37.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is she all right?
Dialogue: 99,1:32:39.14,1:32:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 99,1:32:42.47,1:32:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use this!
Dialogue: 99,1:32:44.52,1:32:48.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,INSIDE THE NERGAL
Dialogue: 99,1:32:49.48,1:32:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, I took down\Nthe Nergal in no time flat!
Dialogue: 99,1:32:53.82,1:32:55.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well? Pretty amazing, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:32:56.36,1:32:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's amazing, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:00.66,1:33:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 99,1:33:01.99,1:33:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little, all I wanted\Nwas for you to be proud of me, Mother.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:06.46,1:33:07.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 99,1:33:08.37,1:33:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I ever did was make you angry.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:12.42,1:33:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I wanted you to tell me I was amazing.\NTo say you were proud of me...
Dialogue: 99,1:33:17.97,1:33:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:20.76,1:33:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't bear to lose you.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:23.35,1:33:25.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were my whole world.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:25.77,1:33:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I put you through so much pain.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:29.19,1:33:31.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right now, Mother.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:31.94,1:33:34.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's start over from the beginning.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:34.98,1:33:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:36.44,1:33:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:38.11,1:33:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't protect you.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:40.95,1:33:42.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so caught up in teaching you,
Dialogue: 99,1:33:43.03,1:33:45.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so blinded by the idea of guiding you,
Dialogue: 99,1:33:45.20,1:33:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I ended up hurting you.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:48.04,1:33:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can finally say it now.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:49.96,1:33:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My words were a sword.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:52.38,1:33:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My silence was a chain.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:55.50,1:33:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As your mother, I never imagined\Nthat I'd come to regret so much.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:00.63,1:34:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 99,1:34:05.26,1:34:07.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't run from reality!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:34:08.77,1:34:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Long, long ago{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:34:12.23,1:34:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There was a lone girl{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:34:15.44,1:34:18.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who wandered the land{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:34:18.65,1:34:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does any of this even matter?
Dialogue: 99,1:34:20.15,1:34:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course it does!
Dialogue: 99,1:34:21.91,1:34:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hang in there, Sapphire!\N- Come on! You can do it!
Dialogue: 99,1:34:26.04,1:34:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 99,1:34:28.50,1:34:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The poor villagers...{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:34:31.00,1:34:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mother, Father...
Dialogue: 99,1:34:33.96,1:34:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still can't forgive me, can you?
Dialogue: 99,1:34:38.01,1:34:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't blame you.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:39.84,1:34:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could see your face\None more time.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:43.43,1:34:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could see your face too, Mother.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:46.76,1:34:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could open this door right now
Dialogue: 99,1:34:49.10,1:34:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and go back to Silver Land\Nand live with all of you again.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:52.40,1:34:53.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 99,1:34:53.85,1:34:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this isn't reality.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:00.15,1:35:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A gift for you.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:01.70,1:35:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It suits you beautifully.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:03.28,1:35:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- I love you, Sapphire.\N- I love you.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:08.20,1:35:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}You offered the same prayer\NAgain and again{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:35:15.75,1:35:18.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you for helping me realize.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:19.17,1:35:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I can finally say this now.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:22.01,1:35:24.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Losing you and Father,
Dialogue: 99,1:35:25.09,1:35:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}it hurts so much.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:50.83,1:35:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's where the Nergal's core is.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:54.25,1:35:55.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:56.00,1:36:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've chosen the pain of reality\Nover the comfort of memories.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:00.96,1:36:02.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:05.68,1:36:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what it means
Dialogue: 99,1:36:07.05,1:36:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to be the Princess Knight!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:18.90,1:36:19.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:33.91,1:36:35.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, get down!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:38.29,1:36:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:40.75,1:36:42.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:42.30,1:36:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:43.26,1:36:44.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave this to us!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:50.60,1:36:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,1:36:57.81,1:36:59.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 99,1:37:02.32,1:37:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:15.75,1:37:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:22.29,1:37:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't do it. Not you.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:30.18,1:37:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's not just you.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:31.72,1:37:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is the same.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:33.85,1:37:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are still people\Nwho haven't given up.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:40.85,1:37:42.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 99,1:37:42.52,1:37:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time I have to protect everyone!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:45.48,1:37:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or I'll never be redeemed.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:49.28,1:37:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:50.45,1:37:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't where
Dialogue: 99,1:37:53.33,1:37:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I truly belong!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:57.04,1:37:58.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not happening!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:05.38,1:38:07.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:07.51,1:38:08.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:09.05,1:38:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? They're gone!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:12.55,1:38:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has already been repeated\Ncountless times.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:15.39,1:38:17.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet, the world has never changed.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:19.14,1:38:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:22.15,1:38:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Attack! Attack! Attack!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:24.98,1:38:28.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this! And this! And this!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:29.11,1:38:30.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:35.62,1:38:37.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll give it back.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:45.25,1:38:47.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't win, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:47.30,1:38:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest already!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:52.09,1:38:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,1:39:00.89,1:39:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 99,1:39:03.15,1:39:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,1:39:43.14,1:39:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world will never change!
Dialogue: 99,1:39:47.61,1:39:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so!
Dialogue: 99,1:39:49.19,1:39:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still want to move forward!
Dialogue: 99,1:39:53.15,1:39:54.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 99,1:40:40.70,1:40:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,TAKARAZUKA REVUE
Dialogue: 99,1:40:41.87,1:40:46.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Encore, encore!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:40:46.54,1:40:50.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Encore, encore!{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:40:50.88,1:40:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you were the other heart\NI was meant to become.
Dialogue: 99,1:40:57.05,1:40:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 99,1:41:00.22,1:41:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope the new world you go to\Nwill be a wonderful one.
Dialogue: 99,1:41:09.23,1:41:11.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,PRINCESS KNIGHT\NOSAMU TEZUKA
Dialogue: 99,1:41:21.20,1:41:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May you be at peace.
Dialogue: 99,1:41:51.52,1:41:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,1:41:53.98,1:41:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 99,1:42:03.33,1:42:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,1:42:05.08,1:42:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,1:42:13.75,1:42:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:15.63,1:42:17.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a ghost.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:18.09,1:42:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Princess Knight,\Nonce more at your service.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:23.05,1:42:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the sake of these children,
Dialogue: 99,1:42:24.93,1:42:27.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was willing\Nto let the world be destroyed.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:27.81,1:42:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That must have been\Nhow your parents felt, too.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:32.60,1:42:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:35.44,1:42:37.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do now?
Dialogue: 99,1:42:37.86,1:42:40.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do to help...
Dialogue: 99,1:42:41.36,1:42:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:42.82,1:42:46.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think I'll go back to Silver Land.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:46.66,1:42:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to give Mother and Father,\Nand the kingdom, a proper farewell.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:53.54,1:42:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you as usual.
Dialogue: 99,1:42:56.71,1:42:59.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,1:42:59.34,1:43:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 99,1:43:00.76,1:43:02.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not making it\Nany easier for Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,1:43:05.55,1:43:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you really going?
Dialogue: 99,1:43:08.85,1:43:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 99,1:43:10.27,1:43:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll write to you\Nonce I'm back in my country.
Dialogue: 99,1:43:12.60,1:43:16.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you and the others hadn't cheered me on\Nback then, I would've lost.
Dialogue: 99,1:43:18.15,1:43:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who broke my curse, Pine.
Dialogue: 99,1:43:22.40,1:43:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 99,1:43:25.78,1:43:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go visit you in Silver Land!
Dialogue: 99,1:43:29.29,1:43:32.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll always be friends!
Dialogue: 99,1:43:32.71,1:43:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Always.
Dialogue: 99,1:43:39.00,1:43:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since then, the Nergal\Nhave not appeared again.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:43:42.80,1:43:45.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seems that battle\Naltered their active cycle.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:43:46.89,1:43:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Poate că într-o bună zi...
Dialogue: 99,1:43:48.85,1:43:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu.
Dialogue: 99,1:43:50.56,1:43:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For now, my hope is that\Nthose who were hurt{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:43:53.44,1:43:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}can heal, slowly, in their own time.{\i}
Dialogue: 99,1:43:56.98,1:44:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that they can find the strength\Nto move forward.{\i}
Comment: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:15.56,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cu mult, mult timp în urmă,
Comment: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:19.10,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}o calamitate cunoscută drept \NNergal a ieșit din Marea Cenușie
Comment: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:23.69,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}și a distrus totul în calea sa.
Comment: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:27.36,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Temut ca Regele Cenușă,
Comment: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.41,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nergalul a fost provocat iar \Nși iar de războinici puternici,
Comment: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:32.28,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar toți au fost răpuși.
Comment: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:36.62,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare cât a trecut
Comment: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.87,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}de când umanitatea \Na renunțat să mai lupte?
Comment: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:44.38,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și totuși, din când în când, \Nun nou erou își face apariția.
Comment: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:50.03,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Eroul cu panglică
Comment: 0,1:44:02.92,1:44:10.72,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Eroul cu panglică
